        <attribute name="Description" id="3168" net="1">
          <![CDATA[Kidney filtration and urine formation in a nephron: pressure sensing with the renin-angiotensin response, glomerular filtration splitting filtrate from blood, proximal tubule glucose, sodium and water reabsorption and acid secretion in parallel, the loop of Henle, aldosterone and parathyroid hormone adjustments in the distal tubule, ADH and thirst in parallel when dehydrated, blood returning through the peritubular capillaries, and the bladder filling over three portions before voluntary urination.]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <graphics count="0"/>
